{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \nGO:0032527 protein exit from endoplasmic reticulum\n[GO:0070862 negative regulation of protein exit from endoplasmic reticulum](https://amigo.geneontology.org/amigo/term/GO:0070862#display-lineage-tab)\n[GO:0070863 positive regulation of protein exit from endoplasmic reticulum](https://amigo.geneontology.org/amigo/term/GO:0070863#display-lineage-tab)\n[GO:0070861 regulation of protein exit from endoplasmic reticulum](https://amigo.geneontology.org/amigo/term/GO:0070861#display-lineage-tab)\nGO:1904211 membrane protein proteolysis involved in retrograde protein transport\n\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/19122\n\n\n**Annotations are here:** https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1t0VaAjlV3E7lOsGizepLz_Az0-GoDrFKciTRB_0CO08/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n\n**Impacted groups:** \n\nAlzheimers_University_of_Toronto\t1 -done\nBHF-UCL\t1 - done\nCACAO\t2\nComplexPortal\t23\nFlyBase\t1\nMGI\t2\nParkinsonsUK-UCL\t2 - done\nSGD\t4\n~TAIR\t6~\n~UniProt\t24~ done\n~WB\t1~ done\n\n\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n> No mappings\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-05T08:52:34Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0032527 protein exit from endoplasmic reticulum & regulation children", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T22:02:47Z"}
